{"version":1,"content":"<p>沙特阿拉伯首都利雅得國際機場過去幾天遭懷疑胡塞武裝無人機和導彈擊中，路透社周二（13日）引述知情人士透露，沙特當局計劃將原定本月底舉行的第10屆「未來投資倡議」（FII）峰會改為線上與線下結合的混合模式，容許環球企業高層網上參與。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.816373+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T06:18:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:38.333169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416436+00:00","content_hash":"557a1e9860dd4df7d0a590499f5fa6055b833c08c63c13185421fe2edc465cce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}